{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5058846","formula":"C₄₁H₅₂N₄O₄S","hill":"C41H52N4O4S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":41.0,"H":52.0,"N":4.0,"O":4.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Cenicriviroc","uk":"Ценікрівірок"},"descriptions":{"en":"Cenicriviroc (INN, code names TAK-652, TBR-652, commonly abbreviated as CVC) is an experimental drug candidate for the treatment of HIV infection and in combination with Tropifexor for non-alcoholic steatohepatitis. It is being developed by Takeda and Tobira Therapeutics. Cenicriviroc is an inhibitor of CCR2 and CCR5 receptors, allowing it to function as an entry inhibitor which prevents the virus from entering into a human cell.","uk":"Ценікрівірок (англ. Cenicriviroc), відомий також як TAK-652 і TBR-652 (міжнародна транскрипція CVC) — синтетичний експериментальний противірусний препарат, розроблений для лікування ВІЛ-інфекції, а в комбінації з препаратом тропіфексор застосовується для лікувального неалкогольного стеатогепатиту. Препарат розроблений у співпраці компаній «Takeda Pharmaceutical» і «Tobira Therapeutics»."},"fame":7,"pubchemCid":11285792,"mass":696.9,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCOCCOC1=CC=C(C=C1)C2=CC/3=C(C=C2)N(CCC/C(=C3)/C(=O)NC4=CC=C(C=C4)[S@@](=O)CC5=CN=CN5CCC)CC(C)C","inchikey":"PNDKCRDVVKJPKG-WHERJAGFSA-N","iupac":"(5E)-8-[4-(2-butoxyethoxy)phenyl]-1-(2-methylpropyl)-N-[4-[(S)-(3-propylimidazol-4-yl)methylsulfinyl]phenyl]-3,4-dihydro-2H-1-benzazocine-5-carboxamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"11285792","atoms":102,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":14.194,"y":-2.268,"z":2.13,"el":"C"},{"x":13.52,"y":-2.17,"z":0.771,"el":"C"},{"x":12.832,"y":-0.823,"z":0.529,"el":"C"},{"x":11.699,"y":-0.506,"z":1.506,"el":"C"},{"x":10.748,"y":-1.564,"z":1.62,"el":"O"},{"x":9.864,"y":-1